,null,null,"餐點類型",null,"0ahUKEwjvxtT-9dmWAxUvma8BHdNYBjQQ3IcHCN4BKAg",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["咖哩豬排飯不錯吃，豬排炸的酥脆，肉也挺有份量的。\n蛋汁豬排就不太優，薄薄一層幾近透明的蛋皮，搭配個人覺得過鹹的醬汁，真心建議調整一下調料比例會更美味。\n蔬菜可樂餅(南瓜口味)好吃，不會太油或太甜。\n泡菜牛肉丼飯份量足，味道也不錯，但稍偏油，吃到後面會有點膩。\n他人丼飯(牛+猪) 整體味道還可以，可能醬汁味道較重，肉片又薄，分不太出來牛肉和豬肉的差別，但肉片份量給的很足，喜歡吃雙拼的人可以嘗試看看。\n泡菜親子丼飯 味道不錯，雞肉和泡菜的份量都很足，可能泡菜本身調味較重，個人覺得醬汁稍微過鹹，但整體來說是好吃的。\n厚切炙燒丼飯 整體味道不錯，但我個人不太喜歡搭配的海苔片的味道，如果配菜有其他選擇的話，可能會更美味一些。",null,[0,98]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13180502974332068581/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhjMHRsVVRkQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13180502974332068581/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhjMHRsVVRkQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13180502974332068581/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhjMHRsVVRkQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13180502974332068581/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhjMHRsVVRkQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13180502974332068581/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhjMHRsVVRkQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13180502974332068581/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhjMHRsVVRkQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,15091,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURXc0tlUTdBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb01a13c33f713de0!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDWsKeQ7AE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURXc0tlUTdBRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURXc0tlUTdBRRIsChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURXc0tlUUhBEhJDZ3NJdmRpamxBWVFrTEthTWcaLgoXQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUNBZ0lEV3NLZVFuQUUSE0Nnd0k5Smkya1FZUXlMeXMzd0kiEgkAAAAAAAAAABHgPXE_wxMasCoLMFhYRGt4NUdkWkY\u0026